# Normalise line endings.
#
# This project is developed from more than one machine, at least one of them
# Windows. Without this, checkouts differ by line ending and git reports whole
# files as changed when nothing meaningful did.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything as LF in the repository and checks out
# LF, so the two machines agree byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated PNGs are binary — never touch them, and never try to diff them.
*.png binary
